    {
      "id": "turn-0062",
      "participantId": "CUSTOMER",
      "channel": 1,
      "offset": 2279800000,
      "duration": 32599999,
      "text": "And the last four are 98, 76."
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-0063",
      "participantId": "REP",
      "channel": 0,
      "offset": 2320200000,
      "duration": 175999999,
      "text": "Thank you. For this test call transcript, I will confirm that the verification information was accepted. I also see a previous mailing address associated with your name. Could you confirm it was 88 Harbor View Drive, Unit 12, Bayport, New York, 11705?"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-0064",
      "participantId": "CUSTOMER",
      "channel": 1,
      "offset": 2504800000,
      "duration": 18399999,
      "text": "Yes, that was my old apartment."
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-0065",
      "participantId": "CUSTOMER",
      "channel": 1,
      "offset": 2531200000,
      "duration": 25200000,
      "text": "I moved from there last autumn after my husband passed."
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-0066",
      "participantId": "CUSTOMER",
      "channel": 1,
      "offset": 2599000000,
      "duration": 25600000,
      "text": "Sorry, I get a little turned around with all the addresses."
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-0067",
      "participantId": "REP",
      "channel": 0,
      "offset": 2632600000,
      "duration": 121400000,
      "text": "I understand, and I am sorry for your loss. You are doing just fine. The installation appointment I have available is Tuesday, August 11th, between 8:00 AM and noon. Would someone be home then?"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-0068",
      "participantId": "CUSTOMER",
      "channel": 1,
      "offset": 2762000000,
      "duration": 24399999,
      "text": "Tuesday the 11th, let me check the calendar."
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-0069",
      "participantId": "CUSTOMER",
      "channel": 1,
      "offset": 2840800000,
      "duration": 41600000,
      "text": "Yes, I believe so. My daughter visits on Wednesdays."
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-0070",
      "participantId": "CUSTOMER",
      "channel": 1,
      "offset": 2891200000,
      "duration": 12200000,
      "text": "Tuesday is good."
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-0071",
      "participantId": "REP",
      "channel": 0,
      "offset": 2911400000,
      "duration": 179399999,
      "text": "Great. The technician will need access to the cable outlet near the television. There is no charge for standard, standard installation. There is a one-time $25 activation fee, and the monthly total today will be $55 plus applicable taxes and fees."
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-0072",
      "participantId": "CUSTOMER",
      "channel": 1,
      "offset": 3099000000,
      "duration": 26399999,
      "text": "I understand. Is the little box included?"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-0073",
      "participantId": "REP",
      "channel": 0,
      "offset": 3133800000,
      "duration": 83199999,
      "text": "Yes, the Wi-Fi gateway is included. To complete the order, may I collect a payment card for the activation fee and monthly billing?"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-0074",
      "participantId": "CUSTOMER",
      "channel": 1,
      "offset": 3225200000,
      "duration": 13600000,
      "text": "Yes, I have it right here."
    },
